      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The petitioner apprehending his arrest in connection with Sector 12 P.S. Case No.135 of 2023 for the offences punishable under Sections 406/420/504/506 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860, pending in the Court of learned Judicial Magistrate 1st Class, Bokaro has prayed for grant of anticipatory bail.",
